  <h1>How to Get Rid of Aphids Indoors: They're Born Pregnant</h1>
</article>
<figure class="hero">
  <img src="/images/how-to-get-rid-of-aphids-indoors.jpg" alt="Aphids clustered on a green leaf with ants tending the colony" loading="eager" width="1344" height="768" />
